    "description": "Stone wall, walk stairs, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 81 blocks vs 60. A straight module with a stone stair flight on the town side up to the walk. Merlons tile across joints: half merlon, crenel, merlon, crenel, merlon (the next module starts with its half merlon). Not yet builder-tested: iron_bars, moss_carpet, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_wall, vine. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, potted_plant.",
